      "view": {
        "mode": "single",
        "stem": "两个球面的球心和半径依次为：① $S(2,-1,3)$，$R=4$；② $S(-5,0,7)$，$R=\\sqrt{3}$。下列哪一组依次给出了这两个球面的方程？",
        "figure_ids": [],
        "options": [
          {
            "id": "A",
            "text": "① $(x+2)^2+(y-1)^2+(z+3)^2=16$；\n\n② $(x-5)^2+y^2+(z+7)^2=3$。",
            "figure_ids": []
          },
          {
            "id": "B",
            "text": "① $(x-2)^2+(y+1)^2+(z-3)^2=4$；\n\n② $(x+5)^2+y^2+(z-7)^2=\\sqrt{3}$。",
            "figure_ids": []
          },
          {
            "id": "C",
            "text": "① $(x-2)^2+(y-1)^2+(z-3)^2=16$；\n\n② $(x-5)^2+y^2+(z-7)^2=3$。",
            "figure_ids": []
          },
          {
            "id": "D",
            "text": "① $(x-2)^2+(y+1)^2+(z-3)^2=16$；\n\n② $(x+5)^2+y^2+(z-7)^2=3$。",
